. local n0 = _N

. 
. * exact duplicate rows (147 in the 2026-09-28 pull, mostly blank records)
. duplicates drop

Duplicates in terms of all variables

(147 observations deleted)

. local n_dup = `n0' - _N

. 
. destring totalunits totalmpdu totalworkforce, replace
totalunits: all characters numeric; replaced as int
(13 missing values generated)
totalmpdu: all characters numeric; replaced as int
(5 missing values generated)
totalworkforce: all characters numeric; replaced as byte
(521 missing values generated)

