> pen data: see notes)"

. label variable total_mpdus          "Total MPDUs in the project (both sources
> ; repeated per offering)"

. label variable mpdus_in_offering    "MPDUs released in this offering (reports
>  only)"

. 
. notes offering_date: For source report, the executed Offering Agreement date 
> (DHCA counts MPDUs as built on this date).

. notes offering_date: For source open_data, the county open data Offering Date
> ; undocumented and often earlier than the actual offering.

. notes total_mpdus: Project total, repeated on every offering row of a project
>  in both sources; do not sum across rows. Sum mpdus_in_offering (reports) for
>  MPDUs built.

. notes mpdus_in_offering: Missing for source open_data (not in the open data).

. 
. order source offering_year offering_date projected_date project_name aka ///
>       site_plan planning_area street_address city zip total_units ///
>       total_mpdus mpdus_in_offering wfh_units open_total_workforce tenure ///
>       developer unit_description

. sort offering_date source

